<div class="story-box">
    <h2>Book 3: Prisoner of Azkaban</h2>
    <img class="story-banner" src="https://images.moviesanywhere.com/1da041f4db01054fe099a9be01ddb6a2/f981fa35-0a7a-449a-ba99-f54a724ce278.jpg" alt="Prisoner of Azkaban">
    <p class="story-body">Fear grips the magical community when the dangerous criminal Sirius Black escapes from the high-security wizard prison, Azkaban. Hooded Dementors surround Hogwarts to guard the school, but as Harry struggles to face his worst fears, a mysterious Marauder's Map and a magical Time-Turner reveal a shocking secret about the night his parents died.</p>
</div>